{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Llamalandia is a cozy adventure game with town-building elements, about finding your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a magical journey across the vast mountains of the Bolivian Altiplano, facing many challenges as you build your llama sanctuary to protect your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/2c6c525f39dce1c56399213025055ddd.poster.avif?t=1755243773\" width=616 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/2c6c525f39dce1c56399213025055ddd.webm?t=1755243773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover breathtaking landscapes, explore mysterious temples, and different ecosystems filled with unique animals and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gather valuable resources as you go. Every expedition offers a new opportunity to discover the unexpected in the vast and enchanting world of Llamalandia! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/0b37caac10015b3bdb00d5e1534dfe3e.poster.avif?t=1755243773\" width=616 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/0b37caac10015b3bdb00d5e1534dfe3e.webm?t=1755243773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your llama sanctuary\u00a0using the resources you gather on your adventures, and watch it grow and thrive as you progress through the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build homes, farms, and other structures, each with a unique function to help you protect and care for your llama family. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/97a1ba88b2e693b246820817154259cd.poster.avif?t=1755243773\" width=616 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/97a1ba88b2e693b246820817154259cd.webm?t=1755243773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the world of Llamalandia to recruit new llamas to your family, and create a unique bond and relationship with each llama you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise the baby llamas to take them on your adventures, watch them grow, and build the biggest and happiest llama community in the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/f6982a0aa60ce833ec703c414e40dc76.poster.avif?t=1755243773\" width=616 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/f6982a0aa60ce833ec703c414e40dc76.webm?t=1755243773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet alpacas, guanacos, armadillos, and other cute animals from the Bolivian Altiplano. Invite them to your sanctuary, but be prepared,\u00a0 because convincing them to join you will be quite a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, interact, and make new friends on your journey!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2470990?t=1755243773","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2470990?t=1755243773","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/bdae5927325b9475168f9d17d7f7b987d09da00f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755243773","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/bdae5927325b9475168f9d17d7f7b987d09da00f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755243773","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3031830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Llamalandia is a cozy adventure game with town-building elements, about finding your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a magical journey across the vast mountains of the Bolivian Altiplano, facing many challenges as you build your llama sanctuary to protect your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/2c6c525f39dce1c56399213025055ddd.poster.avif?t=1755243773\" width=616 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/2c6c525f39dce1c56399213025055ddd.webm?t=1755243773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover breathtaking landscapes, explore mysterious temples, and different ecosystems filled with unique animals and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gather valuable resources as you go. Every expedition offers a new opportunity to discover the unexpected in the vast and enchanting world of Llamalandia! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/0b37caac10015b3bdb00d5e1534dfe3e.poster.avif?t=1755243773\" width=616 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/0b37caac10015b3bdb00d5e1534dfe3e.webm?t=1755243773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your llama sanctuary\u00a0using the resources you gather on your adventures, and watch it grow and thrive as you progress through the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build homes, farms, and other structures, each with a unique function to help you protect and care for your llama family. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/97a1ba88b2e693b246820817154259cd.poster.avif?t=1755243773\" width=616 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/97a1ba88b2e693b246820817154259cd.webm?t=1755243773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the world of Llamalandia to recruit new llamas to your family, and create a unique bond and relationship with each llama you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise the baby llamas to take them on your adventures, watch them grow, and build the biggest and happiest llama community in the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/f6982a0aa60ce833ec703c414e40dc76.poster.avif?t=1755243773\" width=616 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/f6982a0aa60ce833ec703c414e40dc76.webm?t=1755243773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet alpacas, guanacos, armadillos, and other cute animals from the Bolivian Altiplano. Invite them to your sanctuary, but be prepared,\u00a0 because convincing them to join you will be quite a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, interact, and make new friends on your journey!</p>","developers":["Paramo Games"],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/e7bbade17b18781e774de8a65642458ced9223ba/header.jpg?t=1755243773","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2470990/1468551306/eb78126bc899b94f8d9b48c0b47d62c8bbccd93f/1754534612/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754724844","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2470990/1468551306/eb78126bc899b94f8d9b48c0b47d62c8bbccd93f/1754534612/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754724844","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2470990/1468551306/eb78126bc899b94f8d9b48c0b47d62c8bbccd93f/1754534612/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754724844","id":256952268,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256952268/movie480.mp4?t=1754724844","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256952268/movie_max.mp4?t=1754724844"},"name":"Llamalandia Trailer"