iption":"Llamalandia is a cozy adventure game with town-building elements, about finding your family. Build your llama sanctuary to protect your family, raise the baby llamas, and invite other cute animals to live with you in this magical place.","steam_appid":2470990,"support_info":{"email":"support@paramo-games.com","url":"https://paramo-games.com"},"supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America","type":"game","website":"https://paramo-games.com/"}